                                                "sense_id": "a73756ec-28eb-3972-906b-f6156a6ef800",
                                                "text": "For example, the antitumour depsipeptide kahalalide F was isolated from the opisthobranch mollusc Elysia rufescens, and is used by both the mollusc and its dietary alga Bryopsis spp."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6a374d8-837f-4b43-9b50-81d71566594a",
                                                "sense_id": "a73756ec-28eb-3972-906b-f6156a6ef800",
                                                "text": "Searching for hard-shelled prey – molluscs, crabs and the like – there are two species of bear otter in Kanapoi."
